function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#same_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:form {:class "form-inline form-inline-header"} [:select {:name "id", :id "other_games_select", :class "form-control"} [:option {:value ""} "In other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "357350"} "2016"] "\n" [:option {:value "19010000"} "2020"]] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/1028"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "Rugby Sevens, Men" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "24 – 27 July 2024"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/2157"} "Stade de France, Saint-Denis, France"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/2002750"} "159 from 12 countries"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Format"] [:td {:colspan "2"} "Round-robin pools advance teams to single-elimination tournament of eight teams."]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "The men’s tournament took place from 24-27 July at " [:a {:href "/venues/2157"} "Stade de France"] ", in Saint-Denis. Group A included New Zealand, Ireland, South Africa, and Japan. Group B featured Argentina, Australia, Samoa, and Kenya. Finally, Group C had defending champions Fiji, host nation France, the USA, and Uruguay. Fiji was the two-time defending gold medalist and their men had never lost an Olympic match prior to Paris 2024. Other favorites were Argentina, the world’s number one team in the discipline, and New Zealand, always strong in rugby football."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The participation of French rugby union star " [:a {:href "/athletes/153493"} "Antoine Dupont"] " in the rugby sevens tournament raised hopes for a gold medal for France. The team arrived in Paris with confidence following recent victories on the international circuit."] "\n\n" [:p {} "All the favorites advanced through group play, as Fiji continued its undefeated ways. The semi-finals saw France defeat South Africa, which had bested New Zealand in the quarter-finals, and Fiji dominate Australia, 31-7."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The final match was scoreless through the first half but Fiji took the lead, 5-0, on a try by " [:a {:href "/athletes/153595"} "Tristan Leyds"] ". However, France came back on two tries and conversions by " [:a {:href "/athletes/153500"} "Rayan Rebbadj"] " and took the lead 14-5. A final try by " [:a {:href "/athletes/153497"} "Jordan Sépho"] " gave France the gold medal, 19-5."] "\n\n" [:p {} "South Africa won the bronze medal, defeating Australia 26-19, on a try in the last minute by " [:a {:href "/athletes/153593"} "Shaun Williams"] ", followed by the conversion."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button258153", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button258153').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Games Played", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "GP"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Tries"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Conversions"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Penalty Goals"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Drop Goals"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Yellow Cards"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Red Cards"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Wins"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Ties"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Losses"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {:class "accordion-toggle", :data-toggle "collapse", :data-target ".team-members-18100719"